    LLM: 'Game: Handjass (Swiss Jass). 2-4 players, 36-card deck. Trick-taking: follow suit, trump Jack and 9 highest. Scoring: 157 total points per hand. Need 26+ for 1 stroke, 100+ for 2 strokes. Target: 7 strokes.',
    Player: "Handjass: Swiss Jass for 2-4 players. Follow suit if possible. Trump Jack and 9 are highest. Take at least 26 points to avoid a 'null'. First to 7 strokes wins!",
